<title>FINLAND: AMER SEALS MACGREGOR DIVESTMENT.</title>
<headline>AMER SEALS MACGREGOR DIVESTMENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish sporting goods and tobacco group Amer said on Tuesday it has sold its MacGregor Golf Company to British Masters International and Apax Partners at an earlier expected price of about 90 million markka.</p>
<p>&quot;The price did not deviate in any significant way from the earlier expectation (of 90 million markka),&quot; Amer spokewoman told Reuters by telephone.</p>
</text>
